### Lighthouse Audit Requirements
- Performance score > 90
- First Contentful Paint < 1.8s
- Time to Interactive < 3.8s
- Speed Index < 3.4s
- Total Blocking Time < 300ms
- Cumulative Layout Shift < 0.1

## Common Performance Anti-patterns to Avoid

1. Excessive re-renders due to unstable props/callbacks
2. Large, unoptimized images
3. Blocking JavaScript execution
4. Complex component trees without proper memoization
5. Excessive DOM manipulation
6. Non-windowed large data sets
7. Unoptimized third-party scripts
8. Synchronous long-running JavaScript

## Checklist for Component Performance

- [ ] Memoized with React.memo for pure display components
- [ ] Event handlers wrapped in useCallback
- [ ] Complex calculations wrapped in useMemo
- [ ] Proper dependency arrays in hooks
- [ ] Code-split for large component trees
- [ ] Virtualized for large data rendering
- [ ] Images optimized with next/image
- [ ] Proper loading states implemented
- [ ] Data fetching optimized with caching
- [ ] Bundle size minimized with proper imports